          "quote": "(node (ref \"U1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"GND\") (pintype \"power_in\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The transceiver lacks its specified local supply bypass, which can increase supply noise and the risk of unreliable operation during switching.",
      "confidence": 0.92
    },
    {
      "category": "extra_component",
      "components": ["R16"],
      "pins": ["R16.1", "R16.2"],
      "nets": ["+3V3", "GND"],
      "observed": "R16 is a 1 kΩ resistor directly between +3V3 and GND, drawing approximately 3.3 mA continuously. It has no stated function in the specification.",
      "expected": "The +3V3 rail should not have an unexplained 1 kΩ shunt load; R16 should be absent unless an intentional load is specified.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"R16\")\n      (value \"1k\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"R16\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"R16\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The resistor wastes about 11 mW and adds a continuous load to the 3.3 V rail, increasing power consumption and reducing available supply margin.",
      "confidence": 0.84
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist omits the specified MAX3485 decoupling capacitor C5. It also includes an unexplained 1 kΩ resistor directly across +3V3 and GND, adding a continuous load."
}

